  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Polish Exports by financing The Swedish-Polish Chamber of Commerce&apos;s activities in Poland during three years. The activities include raising the level of competence at mostly, SMEs in the areas of exportmarketing, the Swedish market and other relevant subjects. Other activities will be i.a. study visits, particip. at trade fairs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utveckling av polsk export genom finansiering av den Svensk-Polska Handelskammarens verksamhet i Polen under tre &#xe5;r. Verksamheten in- riktas p&#xe5; en handelskammares k&#xe4;rnverksamhet-information och kontakt- f&#xf6;rmedling-samt p&#xe5; praktisk konsulthj&#xe4;lp f&#xf6;r att hj&#xe4;lpa polska och svenska f&#xf6;retag att finna k&#xf6;pare i Sverige resp. underlev. i Polen.</narrative>
  </description>
